0013-gpui-view-wheel-event.patch (combined series, 2026-11-13). Formerly 0012-gpui-view-wheel-event.patch (original kept in nsh-host-patches/superseded-2026-11-13/).
Applies with patch -p1 at the root of a copy of nsh-host-allspeech-src after every earlier patch of the series 0010-0020, in order.

